MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=3
RELEASE_VERSION=0
PRERELEASE=1
DEV_VERSION=4
DESCRIPTION<<DESC_END
WSL #328 validator: bring TAP IFF_UP after TUNSETIFF so test_tap_smoke can TX (Linux write() is EIO while down); default TAP name fltap%d so it does not collide with macvlan fl0; skip linux-modules-extra on Microsoft WSL kernels (package is not in Ubuntu apt); install iptables/nftables when missing; find powershell.exe under /mnt/c/Windows when PATH is root-only; physical-ota preflights iw STA iface (SKIP with usbipd hint when wlan0 is absent — Windows Wi-Fi is not nl80211 in WSL), dumps wifi-dhcp-udp.log on FAIL, and does not UDP-echo 192.168.50.1 against a real AP.
DESC_END

RELEASE_DATE=2026-08-12
